        "body": "Appian Corp is a public company headquartered in McLean, Virginia, trading under the ticker APPN. Its website describes the company as providing AI-powered process orchestration across the enterprise. Appian says it orchestrates AI agents, systems, and people on an enterprise platform without replacing existing systems. The company states it has been automating processes for more than 25 years and serves the world's largest organizations.\n\nThe company's site positions Appian as a provider of AI automation for critical business processes. It says the Appian Platform lets customers build AI-powered processes that accelerate work, reduce cost, and manage risk. The site mentions capabilities for process automation, artificial intelligence, legacy application modernization, accounts payable and receivable, procurement, onboarding, and case management. Appian notes it was named a Leader in the 2025 Gartner Magic Quadrant for Business Orchestration and Automation Technologies (BOAT).\n\nPublic records list Appian Corp with SEC CIK 0001441683 and aliases APPIAN CORP and APPIAN CORP-A. The company has 152 legal exposure matters in Virginia.",
